; They STRADDLE the deck, one on each shoulder -- POWER on the shoulder to the
; left of the raised centre section, RESET on the shoulder to its right, which
; is where the real machine has them. Both together on one side (which is where
; they were first put) reads as a pair of switches on a lunchbox.
[node name="PowerSeat" type="Marker3D" parent="Front"]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, -0.102, 0.045, 0.045)

